{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/a_sch_ground01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/a_sch_ground01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve01",
      "hash64": "9E72D8A91F035100",
      "text": "操場很寬，所以就算放大隻的\\n寶可夢出來也沒問題呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve02",
      "hash64": "9E72DBA91F035619",
      "text": "盯著暴鯉龍的臉看，\\n就會被牠的威嚇降低攻擊耶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve22",
      "hash64": "9E6C6BA91EFE2C1B",
      "text": "聽說熱帶龍就是太喜歡水果了，\\n結果從脖子長出了水果來耶！\\r\\n……怎麼會有這種事！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve24",
      "hash64": "9E6C71A91EFE364D",
      "text": "食堂的料理就是用這片田地\\n出產的食材製作的喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve25",
      "hash64": "9E6C70A91EFE349A",
      "text": "接下來該培育什麼好呢？\\n培育農作物和寶可夢，都有一樣的煩惱呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve26",
      "hash64": "9E6C6FA91EFE32E7",
      "text": "摩托蜥皮膚滑亮滑亮的，好可愛！\\n讀書的疲勞都消失了～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve27",
      "hash64": "9E6C6EA91EFE3134",
      "text": "提供摩托蜥療癒法！\\n想看多久就看多久，隨[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳喜歡喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve29",
      "hash64": "9E6C64A91EFE2036",
      "text": "我和泥驢仔跑了一場馬拉松！\\n牠的持久力太驚人了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve49",
      "hash64": "9E8068A91F0ED00C",
      "text": "我正要和朋友\\n打一場寶可夢對戰呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve50",
      "hash64": "9E7D6BA91F0C9F4E",
      "text": "朋友之間彼此都知道對方有哪些本領，\\n所以推測對手的行動特別重要。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni03",
      "hash64": "FBC87D1909BB1307",
      "text": "莫名其妙就是睡不著，\\n所以我正在校園裡散步。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni05",
      "hash64": "FBC87B1909BB0FA1",
      "text": "之前妮莫她在操場連贏了\\n３０場寶可夢對戰耶！\\r\\n真不愧是冠軍級！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni06",
      "hash64": "FBC8781909BB0A88",
      "text": "妮莫是學生會會長，\\n也是個冠軍，成績又優秀！\\r\\n她有沒有不拿手的事啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni09",
      "hash64": "FBC8771909BB08D5",
      "text": "為了不要在道館緊張，\\n我正看著對戰場在腦海裡模擬對戰！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni16",
      "hash64": "FBCBEA1909BE0215",
      "text": "為了讓牠從鯉魚王進化成暴鯉龍，\\n真是費了我一番功夫呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni21",
      "hash64": "FBC1F31909B5BCDB",
      "text": "耿鬼連睡著時都帶著笑容，\\n實在是太太太～令人喜愛了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni22",
      "hash64": "FBC1F41909B5BE8E",
      "text": "偶爾會有髮型奇怪的學生\\n從校長室走出來喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
